# Shell scripts must survive a Windows checkout: a CRLF shebang script fails under
# Linux `sh` with "set: Illegal option -", which is how the clean-room gate was
# found to be broken when run from the repository rather than a copy.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
NOTICE text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
